BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ran
DTSTART:20250605T020000Z
DTEND:20250605T050500Z
DTSTAMP:20250605T020000Z
UID:MDcRSTm2xK
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 162 mins (2h42m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa’s Academy Award
 -winning adaptation of William Shakespeare’s "King Lear\," Ran consider
 s the disastrous consequences of Lord Hidetora Ichimonji’s (Tatsuya Naka
 dai) decision to split his kingdom among his three sons. 40th Anniversary.
 \n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ran
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
